    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Activates the Entrance Animation upon the character's entry*\n- {passiveImg:once}DEF 150%{passiveImg:up_g} and launches 2 additional attacks, each of\nwhich has a great chance of becoming a Super Attack, for 6 turns\n*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n- All allies' Ki +2 and ATK 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g} and damage reduction rate 10%{passiveImg:up_g} for allies\nwhose names include \"Gamma 1\"\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK 100%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every attack performed*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 200%)\n- {passiveImg:forever}Chance of performing a critical hit 20%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 80%)\n*After performing 4 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Launches an additional Super Attack\n- {passiveImg:once}Foresees enemy's Super Attack for 2 turns from the\ncharacter's next attacking turn\n*When receiving a Ki Blast Super Attack*\n- High chance of nullifying it\n- Nullifies it starting from the 5th turn from the character's entry turn",
